{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EXO","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"出埃及記","commonName":"出埃及記","title":"出埃及記","order":2,"numberOfChapters":40,"sha256":"61798aad81a685f9835bfe998aedebfde8d4930c7a46a050008db0e45788c359","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EXO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":40,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EXO/40.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1208},"chapter":{"number":31,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["會幕的工匠"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對摩西說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「看啊，我已經親自在猶大支派中選出戶珥的孫子、烏利的兒子比撒列，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["用我的靈充滿他，使他有聰明智慧，精於各種技能和手藝，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["能用金、銀和銅製造精巧的器具，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["又能雕刻和鑲嵌寶石，精通木工和各種手藝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我委派但支派亞希撒抹的兒子亞何利亞伯做他的助手。至於其他能工巧匠，我已賜給他們智慧，好照我對你的吩咐製造一切器具，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["即會幕、約櫃和約櫃上面的施恩座、會幕裡面所有的器具、"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["桌子和桌上的器具、純金的燈臺和燈臺的一切器具、香壇、"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["燔祭壇和壇上的一切器具、洗濯盆和盆座，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["還有精工製作的禮服，即亞倫祭司的聖衣及其眾子供祭司之職時穿的禮服，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["以及膏油和聖所使用的芬芳的香。他們要照我對你的吩咐去做。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["安息日"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶和華對摩西說："]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["「你要吩咐以色列百姓務必守我的安息日，因為這是我與你們之間世世代代的記號，叫你們知道使你們聖潔的是我耶和華。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["你們要守安息日，以它為聖日。凡不守這日的，必被處死。凡在這天工作的，必從民中被剷除。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["一週要工作六天，第七天是完全休息的安息日，是耶和華的聖日。凡在安息日做工的，必被處死。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["因此，以色列人世世代代都要守安息日，作為永久的約，"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["這是我和以色列人之間永久的記號。因為耶和華用六天的時間創造天地，在第七天停工休息。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["耶和華在西奈山對摩西說完這些話以後，就把自己用指頭刻上誡命的兩塊石版交給摩西。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EXO/31.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EXO/32.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EXO/30.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}